 es to achieve recovery and finally reclaim its daily life. Just as humanit
 y managed to cling to a hard-won peace\, a new threat strikes\, crushing h
 ope in an instant. There is no third time. Everything ends here.\n\nStarri
 ng: Ryunosuke Kamiki\, Minami Hamabe\, Yuki Yamada\, Kuranosuke Sasaki\, J
 un Kunimura\, Miou Tanaka\n\nFilm release at Merlin Cinemas Falmouth\nBook
